## style-ok: no-strict
## Sourced genmkfile override fragment: a strict-mode block would leak
## errexit/nounset/pipefail into the genmkfile build shell that sources it.

## The frozen-snapshot lintian emits maintainer-script-should-not-use-dpkg-maintscript-helper
## for the dpkg-maintscript-helper calls dh_installdeb auto-generates from
## debian/systemcheck.maintscript (rm_conffile). The package already uses the
## .maintscript mechanism lintian itself recommends, so the tag is a
## version-skew false-positive (host lintian 2.122 does not emit it). Suppress
## only this one tag, only for this package.
genmkfile_lintian_post_opts+=" --suppress-tags maintainer-script-should-not-use-dpkg-maintscript-helper "
